---
layout: compress
---
{%- comment -%}
Which wallets exist and where their source lives; consumed by
external/source_analysis. Only appId, platform and repository on purpose; the analyser
reads versions from the repository itself, the site's version field lags.
Records without a repository, and apps that are gone (removed, defunct,
discontinued, deprecated), are left out.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign platforms = "android,iphone,desktop,hardware,bearer" | split: "," -%}
{%- assign goneMetas = "removed,defunct,discontinued,deprecated" | split: "," -%}
{%- assign out = "" -%}
{%- for platform in platforms -%}
{%- for post in site[platform] -%}
{%- assign repo = post.repository | strip -%}
{%- if repo != "" -%}
{%- unless goneMetas contains post.meta -%}
{%- assign appIdJson = post.appId | jsonify -%}
{%- assign repoJson = repo | jsonify -%}
{%- assign out = out | append: ',{"appId":' | append: appIdJson | append: ',"platform":"' | append: platform | append: '","repository":' | append: repoJson | append: '}' -%}
{%- endunless -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endfor -%}
[{{ out | remove_first: "," }}]
